  clock: 2  # 031b
  nonce: 031b  # 031b
  message: "Materialized from dogfood tranche 05 (F84.A1 / anon-card-003). Mechanism: node.id trailing kind-segment value contradicts the node.kind field. Evidence: frozen substrate.json (probe_2_kindmismatch.log, probe_2_pyweird.log) — 1670 nodes total; 8 starlette route nodes id=...:route kind=function name='starlette:_<handler>'; fresh run on serve.py copy reproduces. Magnitude: 1670 nodes (1312/214/106 external_symbol arguably-expected + route->function 8, event_subscriber->function 11, event_publisher->function 3 real disagreements). Blind severity 3/5, reproduced on frozen substrate + fresh run. RELATED_BUT_DISTINCT from INV-dulah (id FORMAT escaping the 5-segment shape — here the format is intact but the kind segment's VALUE contradicts the kind field), parent META INV-kurup (identifier-bearing non-canonical formats), F100.A1/WI-vuzaf (id NAME-segment vs node.name — the sibling slot mismatch), and INV-nubub (handler-slice route/function collision — same starlette double-node root)."  # 031b
