  clock: 9  # ab4c
  nonce: ab4c  # ab4c
  message: "2026-06-10 design-interview ruling (ADR-0036, merged in PR #4181): the node.id kind slot must always equal node.kind; use-site reference syntax moves to a registered meta key instead of overloading the kind slot. That settles the design question here — the ~1645 external_symbol disagreements are nonconforming under the new grammar, not arguably-expected normalization. Item now waits on the implementing fix (emit node.kind in the slot, reference syntax via the meta key)."  # ab4c
